  {
   "id": "UDIP-BTBAQAJ",
   "from": "M. Viviana Toro Ibacache",
   "author": "4f0d23cd16ae662b",
   "date": "2017-08-30T14:59:01Z",
   "subject": "How to highlight the edges of a polygon",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Dear Colleagues,<br><br></div>Does anyone know how to highlight the edges of a polygon (.ply) surface that opens in a rgl device while using geomorph? It is a very simple polygon which I wrote myself, but because of how it looks, it is hard to see shape changes: lighter lines (in the image, signed with red arrows) are the edges, but I would like to make them black.<br><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/geomorph-r-package/attach/1c114f80f3250/image.png?part=0.1&amp;view=1\" alt=\"Imagen integrada 1\" style=\"margin-right:0px\" width=\"185\" height=\"272\"><br clear=\"all\"><div><div>I tried also editing the original ply file, but nothing happens. I can only add colors to the faces, but nothing happens to the edges. Is it even possible to do this? I am almost certain I did it accidentally a couple of days ago while playing with rgl.material arguments, but I did not record this, and as much as I try now, I get nothing.</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks for your help,</div><div>Viviana</div><div><br></div><div>-- <br><div class=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><font size=\"1\" face=\"tahoma, sans-serif\" color=\"#444444\"><b><br>Viviana Toro-Ibacache DDS MSc PhD</b></font><div><font size=\"1\" face=\"tahoma, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">Profesora Asistente <i>(Assistant Professor)</i><br></font><font size=\"1\" face=\"tahoma, sans-serif\">Centro de Análisis Cuantitativo en Antropología Dental (CA2)</font><font size=\"1\" face=\"tahoma, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\"><br></font></div><div><font size=\"1\" face=\"tahoma, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">Unidad de Anatomía, Instituto de Investigación en Ciencias Odontológicas</font></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:x-small\">Facultad de Odontología Universidad de Chile</span><br></div><div><div><font size=\"1\" face=\"tahoma, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\"><br></font></div><div><font size=\"1\" face=\"tahoma, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">Dirección:  Sergio Livingstone Pohlhammer 943</font></div><div><i style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:x-small\">(address)</i><font size=\"1\" face=\"tahoma, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">   Independencia, Región Metropolitana</font></div><div><font size=\"1\" face=\"tahoma, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">                 Chile</font></div><div><font size=\"1\" face=\"tahoma, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">Email:        <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">mtoroi...@odontologia.uchile.cl</a></font></div></div><div><font size=\"1\"><font face=\"tahoma, sans-serif\">Web:         </font><a href=\"http://www.researchgate.net/profile/Viviana_Toro_Ibacache/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.researchgate.net/profile/Viviana_Toro_Ibacache/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792486039269000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0d-1eSvr_moXnzGOp9jlv-\">www.researchgate.net/profile/Viviana_Toro_Ibacache/</a></font><br></div><div><font color=\"#000000\"><font size=\"1\"><font face=\"tahoma, sans-serif\">                 <a href=\"http://www.cienciaymemoria.cl/staff.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.cienciaymemoria.cl/staff.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792486039269000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0XRwlobZPs6ne7OUX3Kxd7\">www.cienciaymemoria.cl/staff.html</a></font></font></font><br></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\r\n</div></div></div>\r\n"
